## Model card

- **Name:** Qoder Sonus
- **Short description:** Computer-operation specialized model; performs coding, financial modeling, and complex desktop/software tasks.
- **Provider / access:** Qoder built-in model, available across Qoder, Qoder IDE, Qoder CLI, JetBrains plugin, QoderWake, Cloud Agents. Credit-based pricing.
- **Release / knowledge:** Announced 2026-09-10; knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** qoder/sonus-1.0
- **Context window:** 128K total per meta.json.
- **Modalities:** Text in/out per meta; Computer Use claims per forum announcements.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-21):** Qoder Credits, reference factor 8x per release notes; SOTA rate applies.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary; vendor does not publish parameters or weights.

